WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Hillside police.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.260
Detective Malloy, please.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:17.080
I would like to report a crime.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.060
For those of you who don't know me, I am Doctor Birch, and this is the philosophy of language.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.720
Daddy's home !

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:26.580
What are you guys still doing up?

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.160
Daddy, there's a crazy person in the woods.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.440
What's he talking about?

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:31.920
Oh, girl went missing up at the lake.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.620
Ellen Birch?

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:35.120
Yes?

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:35.960
Is your husband home?

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.500
What's this about, detective?

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:45.140
We got a report, a man in a gray Volvo was watching the other day she disappeared.

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:47.500
Can you tell me where you were?

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:48.560
I doubt it.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.040
I can barely remember last week.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.480
That was his last day of camp.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.000
You went to pick her up, remember?

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:56.280
Our counselor said you waited for 40 minutes.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.660
Is tardiness a crime?

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:58.580
Obstruction is.

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:02.120
I'm not answering another question until I speak to my lawyer.

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:03.680
Are you used to a case like this?

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.280
Well, do you mean a kidnapping?

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:06.640
Or do you mean a murder?

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:08.060
Did you ever meet Joyce Bonner?

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:10.220
I don't think so.

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:12.855
When a kid goes missing here, the cops need a suspect.

00:01:12.855 --> 00:01:14.660
Coincidence put you in the crosshairs.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.140
Cops don't ask questions.

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:17.320
They plant landmines.

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:18.200
Mrs Birch...

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.660
We found strands of Joyce's hair in your husband's car.

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:24.220
What was she doing in your car?

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:25.320
I told you, I don't remember.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:27.200
This is her lipgloss, Zelda found it.

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:28.780
They must have planted it.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:29.760
This is a lie.

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:33.560
She's out there and if she's still alive she's on borrowed time.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.514
Philosophy. We're in the same bracket.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:37.600
Searching for the truth.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:41.600
Do you have trouble remembering things a detective can call, sequences?

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:42.840
You tell me.

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:46.120
So, there is no such thing as truth.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.000
Can I tell you the truth or what I perceive?

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:51.340
You kept a secret from your wife?

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:52.860
Will you please calm down?

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:54.540
I'm sick of being calm.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.200
I'm terrified what else you could convince yourself of.

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:11.980
You know me. I wouldn't hurt a fly.

